{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>תוחלת צדיקים</b> — that they hope to see the death of the wicked; the end of their hoping will bring them to joy on account of them at their death." "<b>ותקות רשע</b> — to destroy the righteous; the desire will perish, and this is explicit in the following verse."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:00.789535981Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}